}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get All Visual Designs
  Retrieves all AI-generated visual design records belonging to the currently authenticated user (`req.user.id`).

  ### Authentication
  - **Bearer Token** required (`Authorization: Bearer <token>`).

  ### Responses
  - `200 OK`: JSON array of visual design objects.
  - `401 Unauthorized`: Missing or invalid JWT token.
  - `500 Internal Server Error`: Unexpected error while fetching visual designs (`{ "message": "Hiba történt a látványtervek lekérése közben." }`).
}